===Etymology 2===
{{inh+|ru|zle-mru|козырь}} (att. 1641), {{m|zle-mru|козирь}}. Origin {{unk|ru|unclear}}, but suggested to be connected to [[коза]].

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|e|ко́зырь|m|adj=козырно́й}}

# {{lb|ru|obsolete}} [[high]] [[stand]]ing [[collar]]
# {{lb|ru|obsolete}} or {{lb|ru|regional}} [[canopy]] over a horse-drawn cart, sleigh
# {{lb|ru|obsolete}} or {{lb|ru|regional}} [[peak]], [[visor]]

